## Title: |cff66f366DoHelper|r HoT Prediction
## Notes: DoHelper (addon folder EllesmereUI_HoTPrediction): player self-cast HoT prediction, real queued next-swing ability borders, a persistent notes pad, a stylable +combat/-combat indicator, and a Weapon training reference tab. The addon folder and SavedVariables keep their historical EllesmereUI_HoTPrediction names for settings compatibility.
